			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 761840101,
					"content": "哟，真是新奇。想不到我还有一天能被邀请参加桑多涅你的茶会。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761840102
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「公子」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761840102,
					"content": "要是你的茶会礼仪好一些的话，我以前说不定还会考虑考虑多邀请你几次。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761840103
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「木偶」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761840103,
					"content": "同意。而且最好不要每次都提出要和我们当中的人比试一番。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761840104
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「仆人」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761840104,
					"content": "你们怎么和我家里的哥哥姐姐一样，老这么说我。没办法，以前在野外接受师父训练的时候，不太注意这些。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761840105
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「公子」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761840105,
					"content": "算了，能这么聚在一起的机会也不多。还是安心享受当下的时光吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761840106
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「木偶」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761840106,
					"content": "哦？这就是你的最新机器？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761840107
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「公子」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761840107,
					"content": "她叫法洁欧。全功能通用型自动机关。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761840108
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「木偶」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761840108,
					"content": "这么看来，普隆尼亚那个大家伙是真的无法被修复了吗…我很遗憾，桑多涅。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761840109
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「公子」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761840109,
					"content": "没事的，我…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761840110
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「木偶」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761840110,
					"content": "我很遗憾没能和他打上一场。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761840111
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「公子」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761840111,
					"content": "我就知道…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761840112
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「木偶」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761840112,
					"content": "那个大家伙看起来真的挺强，法洁欧看起来…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761840113
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「公子」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761840113,
					"content": "…你是想说她看起来很弱吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761840114
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「木偶」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761840114,
					"content": "呃…哈哈，没有没有。只是，看起来没普隆尼亚那个大家伙那么强而已。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761840115
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「公子」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761840115,
					"content": "啧，普隆尼亚是算术机械，他的战斗能力是我在不影响他算力的基础上添加的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761840116
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「木偶」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761840116,
					"content": "但法洁欧无需处理复杂的术式，换言之，她的所有算力，都能够用于处理战斗模块。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761840117
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「木偶」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761840117,
					"content": "也就是…比普隆尼亚更厉害的意思？真的假的…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761840118
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「公子」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761840118,
					"content": "我看你是真的想开开眼界是吧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761840119
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「木偶」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761840119,
					"content": "先说好，打坏了我可不付维修费。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761840120
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「公子」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761840120,
					"content": "我可不付医药费。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761840121
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「木偶」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761840121,
					"content": "（哎…果然还是发展成这样了。）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761840122
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「仆人」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761840122,
					"content": "（嚼嚼…）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "「少女」"
				}
			]
		},
